// A random ROOM cell (always odd grid coordinates, see
// game/sim/maze/gen/run.id's comment on the odd/even grid trick): 1 + 2*k
// for k in 0..room-count-1, where room-count = (grid_w()-1)/2 (or grid_h()).

rand_room_x() {
} return int 1 + 2 * (rng_next() % ((grid_w() - 1) / 2));

rand_room_z() {
} return int 1 + 2 * (rng_next() % ((grid_h() - 1) / 2));
